{"title": "Expanded Facility", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityMain.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityMain.jpg/320px-ExpandedFacilityMain.jpg?52c7ee\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityMain.jpg/480px-ExpandedFacilityMain.jpg?52c7ee 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityMain.jpg/640px-ExpandedFacilityMain.jpg?52c7ee 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityMain.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The main entrance of the Expanded Facility.</div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Expanded Facility</b> is a variation of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Interiors#The_Factory\">Facility</a>, also referred to as Factory, interior that adds many extra tiles and some minor features. It most commonly spawns on <a href=\"/wiki/ResearcherxB\" title=\"ResearcherxB\">ResearcherxB</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Release\" title=\"Release\">Release</a>. The latter has a unique trial there instead of a <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><b>Secondary Objective</b></a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Rooms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Rooms</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Features\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Features</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Hazards\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Hazards</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Secondary Objectives</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Restart_the_Power\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Restart the Power</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Fix_the_Breakers\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fix the Breakers</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Control_the_Pressure\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Control the Pressure</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Rewards\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rewards</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Rooms\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Rooms\">&gt; Rooms</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Nail Machine</b> - A machine that generates in a large <b>Wire Room</b> typically close by the Main Entrance. There are several server racks in the room and two <b>Fuses</b> on a stool next to the machine. This machine holds the reward for completing a <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><b>Secondary Objective</b></a>.</li>\n<li><b>Wire Room</b> - A large or small room with various wires on the roof and wall and a metal floor.</li>\n<li><b>Additional Server Rooms</b> - A handful of other rooms with severs now generate. One has a window that looks into it and another has a staircase.</li>\n<li><b>Large Storage</b> - A large room with a few shelving units inside and big boxes inside.</li>\n<li><b>Backup Power</b> - A small room with shelving units and a sign that reads \"BACKUP POWER\".</li>\n<li><b>Square Catwalk</b> - Catwalks connecting to each other in a room to form a square.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Features\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Features\">&gt; Features</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Rotating Platform</b> - Scrap can be placed on small platforms that rotate by pushing a red button. This is primarily useful for transporting scrap past an <b>Electrical Gate</b>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Hazards\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Hazards\">&gt; Hazards</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Electrical Gate</b> - Primarily spawns in front of small storage rooms with a warning sign that reads \"DO NOT CROSS WITH MECHANICAL PARTS\". Holding \"mechanical parts\" in the player's hand and attempting to pass through this gate deals 99 damage to the player. \"Mechanical parts\" are any scrap tagged as <b>lethal_company:metal</b> (Cash registers, Clown horns, Big bolts, etc.) and the <b>Machine parts</b> scrap. The <b>Rotating Platform</b> can be used to safely transport scrap past the gate, but the player can also just drop the scrap near the gate, walk to the other side, and safely grab it.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Secondary_Objectives\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\">&gt; Secondary Objectives</span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityNailMachine.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityNailMachine.jpg/320px-ExpandedFacilityNailMachine.jpg?ac21c0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityNailMachine.jpg/480px-ExpandedFacilityNailMachine.jpg?ac21c0 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityNailMachine.jpg/640px-ExpandedFacilityNailMachine.jpg?ac21c0 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityNailMachine.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The Nail Machine with the Fuses next to it.</div></div></div><p>One of three unique objectives will randomly generate for players to complete for one of three valuable rewards that will spawn after twisting the dial on the <b>Nail Machine</b>.\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Restart_the_Power\">Restart the Power</span></h3>\n<p>Players must bring and insert a <b>Fuse</b> into two panels found in the interior. Once inserted, players can interact with the dial and cause a light to start sequentially going from top to bottom on the side. Players must pull the crank on the right at the same time that light is over the yellow circle three times, with the yellow circle potentially changing positions and the light speeding up or slowing down to throw players off. There is also a delay between the light going from the bottom back to the top circle.\n</p><p>Once both panels have successfully turned on, players can return to the <b>Nail Machine</b> and twist the dial for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fix_the_Breakers\">Fix the Breakers</span></h3>\n<p>Players must bring and insert a <b>Fuse</b> into two panels of switches found in the interior. Once inserted, players must flick all the switches in a specific but random order. Flicking the switches in the incorrect order will cause all switches to reset. If successful, a sound effect will play and the panel can no longer be interacted with.\n</p><p>Once both panels are activated, players can return to the <b>Nail Machine</b> and twist the dial for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Control_the_Pressure\">Control the Pressure</span></h3>\n<p>Players must bring and insert both <b>Fuses</b> into a panel hooked up to a machine with several valves that generates in a <b>Large Storage</b> room. Typically, this room is either near the main entrance or connected to the large open room. After activation, players can simply do nothing and the pressure will stabilize after about 180 seconds. However, players can turn the valves on the machine that are releasing steam to stabilize the pressure faster.\n</p><p>Once stabilized, all the valves will turn and a sound effect will play. Players can now return to the <b>Nail Machine</b> and twist the dial for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h3>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Expanded Facility Secondary Rewards\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Base Value</th>\n<th>Minimum Value</th>\n<th>Minimum Solo Value</th>\n<th>Maximum Value</th>\n<th>Maximum Solo Value\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Big nail</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Big_nail.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Big nail.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Big_nail.png/60px-Big_nail.png?ccb010\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Big_nail.png/90px-Big_nail.png?ccb010 1.5x, /images/thumb/Big_nail.png/120px-Big_nail.png?ccb010 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>187</td>\n<td>223</td>\n<td>260\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Big steel nail</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Big_steel_nail.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Big steel nail.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Big_steel_nail.png/60px-Big_steel_nail.png?263278\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Big_steel_nail.png/90px-Big_steel_nail.png?263278 1.5x, /images/thumb/Big_steel_nail.png/120px-Big_steel_nail.png?263278 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>270</td>\n<td>270</td>\n<td>315</td>\n<td>377</td>\n<td>441\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Big golden nail</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Big_golden_nail.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Big golden nail.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Big_golden_nail.png/60px-Big_golden_nail.png?cdb4a4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Big_golden_nail.png/90px-Big_golden_nail.png?cdb4a4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Big_golden_nail.png/120px-Big_golden_nail.png?cdb4a4 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>420</td>\n<td>420</td>\n<td>491</td>\n<td>587</td>\n<td>686\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p>The reward is randomized, but the chance for a more valuable reward is increased by how early in the day players complete the objective and is influenced by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics#Furniture_luck\">the vanilla luck system</a>. The value of the reward is additionally increased by a difficulty multiplier, ranging from 0.6x to 1.4x, and a solo (singleplayer) multiplier of 1.17x. <b>Control the Pressure</b> is considered Easy difficulty and has a 1.0x multiplier, <b>Restart the Power</b> is considered Medium difficulty and has a 1.15x multiplier, and <b>Fix the Breakers</b> is considered Hard difficulty and has a 1.4x multiplier. The base value and multipliers for objective rewards can be adjusted in the Wesleys Interior Tools config under the Secondary Objectives section.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityServer1.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"An additional server room with a staircase.\"><img alt=\"An additional server room with a staircase.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityServer1.jpg/120px-ExpandedFacilityServer1.jpg?8a282d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityServer1.jpg/180px-ExpandedFacilityServer1.jpg?8a282d 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityServer1.jpg/240px-ExpandedFacilityServer1.jpg?8a282d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">An additional server room with a staircase.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityServer2.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"An additional server room.\"><img alt=\"An additional server room.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityServer2.jpg/120px-ExpandedFacilityServer2.jpg?1c498c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityServer2.jpg/180px-ExpandedFacilityServer2.jpg?1c498c 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityServer2.jpg/240px-ExpandedFacilityServer2.jpg?1c498c 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">An additional server room.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityLargeStorage.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A large storage room.\"><img alt=\"A large storage room.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityLargeStorage.jpg/120px-ExpandedFacilityLargeStorage.jpg?ebf37d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityLargeStorage.jpg/180px-ExpandedFacilityLargeStorage.jpg?ebf37d 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityLargeStorage.jpg/240px-ExpandedFacilityLargeStorage.jpg?ebf37d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A large storage room.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityWires.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A small room with various wires.\"><img alt=\"A small room with various wires.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityWires.jpg/120px-ExpandedFacilityWires.jpg?13659d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityWires.jpg/180px-ExpandedFacilityWires.jpg?13659d 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityWires.jpg/240px-ExpandedFacilityWires.jpg?13659d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A small room with various wires.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityBackup.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A room labeled &quot;BACKUP POWER&quot;.\"><img alt=\"A room labeled &quot;BACKUP POWER&quot;.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityBackup.jpg/120px-ExpandedFacilityBackup.jpg?975995\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityBackup.jpg/180px-ExpandedFacilityBackup.jpg?975995 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityBackup.jpg/240px-ExpandedFacilityBackup.jpg?975995 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A room labeled \"BACKUP POWER\".</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityCatwalk.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A square catwalk.\"><img alt=\"A square catwalk.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityCatwalk.jpg/120px-ExpandedFacilityCatwalk.jpg?d4200e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityCatwalk.jpg/180px-ExpandedFacilityCatwalk.jpg?d4200e 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityCatwalk.jpg/240px-ExpandedFacilityCatwalk.jpg?d4200e 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A square catwalk.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityPlatform.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A rotating platform with a gold bar placed on it.\"><img alt=\"A rotating platform with a gold bar placed on it.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityPlatform.jpg/120px-ExpandedFacilityPlatform.jpg?eb7e80\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityPlatform.jpg/180px-ExpandedFacilityPlatform.jpg?eb7e80 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityPlatform.jpg/240px-ExpandedFacilityPlatform.jpg?eb7e80 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A rotating platform with a gold bar placed on it.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityInterior.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"An electrical gate.\"><img alt=\"An electrical gate.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityInterior.png/120px-ExpandedFacilityInterior.png?ca82fe\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityInterior.png/180px-ExpandedFacilityInterior.png?ca82fe 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityInterior.png/240px-ExpandedFacilityInterior.png?ca82fe 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">An electrical gate.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityStool.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A small room with stools in it.\"><img alt=\"A small room with stools in it.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityStool.jpg/120px-ExpandedFacilityStool.jpg?627187\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityStool.jpg/180px-ExpandedFacilityStool.jpg?627187 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityStool.jpg/240px-ExpandedFacilityStool.jpg?627187 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A small room with stools in it.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityPower.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A panel for the Restart the Power objective.\"><img alt=\"A panel for the Restart the Power objective.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityPower.jpg/120px-ExpandedFacilityPower.jpg?ed6ad7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityPower.jpg/180px-ExpandedFacilityPower.jpg?ed6ad7 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityPower.jpg/240px-ExpandedFacilityPower.jpg?ed6ad7 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A panel for the Restart the Power objective.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityBreaker.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A switch panel for the Fix the Breakers objective.\"><img alt=\"A switch panel for the Fix the Breakers objective.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityBreaker.jpg/120px-ExpandedFacilityBreaker.jpg?4c22ad\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityBreaker.jpg/180px-ExpandedFacilityBreaker.jpg?4c22ad 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityBreaker.jpg/240px-ExpandedFacilityBreaker.jpg?4c22ad 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A switch panel for the Fix the Breakers objective.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedFacilityPressure.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The pressure machine for the Control the Pressure objective.\"><img alt=\"The pressure machine for the Control the Pressure objective.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityPressure.jpg/120px-ExpandedFacilityPressure.jpg?3f57cc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityPressure.jpg/180px-ExpandedFacilityPressure.jpg?3f57cc 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedFacilityPressure.jpg/240px-ExpandedFacilityPressure.jpg?3f57cc 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The pressure machine for the Control the Pressure objective.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul></div>", "images": ["ExpandedFacilityServer1.jpg", "ExpandedFacilityServer2.jpg", "ExpandedFacilityLargeStorage.jpg", "ExpandedFacilityWires.jpg", "ExpandedFacilityBackup.jpg", "ExpandedFacilityCatwalk.jpg", "ExpandedFacilityPlatform.jpg", "ExpandedFacilityInterior.png", "ExpandedFacilityStool.jpg", "ExpandedFacilityPower.jpg", "ExpandedFacilityBreaker.jpg", "ExpandedFacilityPressure.jpg", "ExpandedFacilityMain.jpg", "ExpandedFacilityNailMachine.jpg", "Big_nail.png", "Big_steel_nail.png", "Big_golden_nail.png"], "cats": []}